---
permalink: /updates/index.html
---
{%- set latest = collections.publishedDevelopmentUpdates[0] -%}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Development Updates — Aircraft Tycoon</title>
<meta name="description" content="Development updates, gameplay system previews and production news for Aircraft Tycoon."/>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://aircraft-tycoon.com/updates/"/>
<meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
<meta property="og:title" content="Aircraft Tycoon Development Updates"/>
<meta property="og:description" content="Gameplay systems, visual development and milestones from Aircraft Tycoon."/>
<meta property="og:image" content="{{ latest.data.update.cover.absoluteUrl }}"/>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site.css"/>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/updates.css"/>
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav">
<div class="wrap navin">
<a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brandmark">AT</span><span>Aircraft Tycoon</span></a>
<nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="links">
<a href="/"><span class="language-copy" data-lang="en">Home</span><span class="language-copy" data-lang="pt" hidden>Início</span></a>
<a href="/updates/"><span class="language-copy" data-lang="en">Updates</span><span class="language-copy" data-lang="pt" hidden>Atualizações</span></a>
<a href="mailto:contact@aircraft-tycoon.com"><span class="language-copy" data-lang="en">Contact</span><span class="language-copy" data-lang="pt" hidden>Contacto</span></a>
<div class="lang" aria-label="Language"><button class="active" id="en" type="button">EN</button><button id="pt" type="button">PT</button></div>
</nav>
</div>
</header>
<main class="updates-page">
<section class="updates-hero">
<div class="wrap language-copy" data-lang="en"><div class="kicker">Development journal</div><h1>Development Updates</h1><p class="updates-intro">Gameplay systems, visual development and milestones from the ongoing production of Aircraft Tycoon.</p></div>
<div class="wrap language-copy" data-lang="pt" hidden><div class="kicker">Diário de desenvolvimento</div><h1>Atualizações de Desenvolvimento</h1><p class="updates-intro">Sistemas de gameplay, desenvolvimento visual e marcos da produção contínua de Aircraft Tycoon.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="wrap update-list">
{%- for item in collections.publishedDevelopmentUpdates %}
{%- set update = item.data.update %}
<article class="update-card">
<a class="update-card-media" href="{{ item.url }}" aria-label="Read the {{ update.category }} development update"><img class="update-shot" src="{{ update.cover.src }}" alt="{{ update.cover.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></a>
<div class="update-card-body language-copy" data-lang="en"><div class="update-meta"><span>{{ update.displayDate.en }}</span><span>{{ update.category }}</span></div><h2>{{ update.title.en }}</h2><p>{{ update.surfaces.archive.excerpt.en }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ item.url }}">Read the update →</a></div>
<div class="update-card-body language-copy" data-lang="pt" hidden><div class="update-meta"><span>{{ update.displayDate.pt }}</span><span>{{ update.category }}</span></div><h2>{{ update.title.pt }}</h2><p>{{ update.surfaces.archive.excerpt.pt }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ item.url }}">Ler a atualização →</a></div>
</article>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
</section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footerin"><div><div class="brand"><span class="brandmark">AT</span><span>Aircraft Tycoon</span></div><p><span class="language-copy" data-lang="en">Independent historical aviation management game.</span><span class="language-copy" data-lang="pt" hidden>Jogo independente de gestão histórica da aviação.</span></p></div><div style="max-width:500px;font-size:13px"><span class="language-copy" data-lang="en">All visuals are work in progress and do not represent final quality or guaranteed final content.</span><span class="language-copy" data-lang="pt" hidden>Todos os elementos visuais estão em desenvolvimento e não representam a qualidade final nem garantem que o conteúdo apresentado esteja presente na versão final.</span></div></div></footer>
<script src="/assets/js/updates.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
